# Accepted IaC findings. Each entry is a deliberate trade-off, reviewed and documented.

# EKS API endpoint is public so GitHub-hosted runners (no fixed IPs) can deploy.
# Every request is still authenticated with IAM, and the deploy role is limited
# to one namespace. Narrow cluster_endpoint_public_access_cidrs for laptop-only use.
AWS-0040
AWS-0041

# Worker nodes need outbound internet (via NAT) to pull images from GHCR and ECR.
AWS-0104

# ingress_mode = "hostport" only: worker nodes sit in public subnets with public IPs so
# Traefik can answer on port 80 without a load balancer. The node security group admits
# only port 80 (plus EKS control-plane traffic). The default "nlb" mode keeps nodes private.
AWS-0164
